---
description: Catch values are Error. Do not annotate them as unknown or cast with as Error.
globs: '**/*.ts,**/*.tsx'
alwaysApply: true
---

`useUnknownInCatchVariables` is false, so `catch (error)` is already
`Error`. Do not write `catch (error: unknown)` or `error as Error`.

```ts
// Avoid
} catch (error: unknown) {
  const message = (error as Error).message;
}

// Prefer
} catch (error) {
  const message = error.message;
}
```
